{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer\/symbolavoidsedges"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Whether symbols in this layer avoid colliding with symbols in adjacent tiles.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/symbolAvoidsEdges","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSExpression","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSExpression","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"symbolAvoidsEdges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If this property is set to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", symbols in this layer avoid crossing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge of a tile. You should set this property to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" if the backing vector"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tiles don’t have enough padding to prevent collisions, or if this layer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"symbolPlacement"},{"type":"text","text":" property is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolPlacement\/MLNSymbolPlacementPoint"},{"type":"text","text":" but this layer is above a symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"symbolPlacement"},{"type":"text","text":" property is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolPlacement\/MLNSymbolPlacementPoint"},{"type":"text","text":". You do not need to enable this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property to prevent clipped labels at tile boundaries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value of this property is an expression that evaluates to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":". Set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this property to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" to reset it to the default value."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This attribute corresponds to the "},{"type":"text","text":"symbol-avoid-edges"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout property in the MapLibre Style Spec."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can set this property to an expression containing any of the following:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Constant Boolean values"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Predefined functions, including mathematical and string operators"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Conditional expressions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Variable assignments and references to assigned variables"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Step functions applied to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$zoomLevel"},{"type":"text","text":" variable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property does not support applying interpolation functions to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$zoomLevel"},{"type":"text","text":" variable or applying interpolation or step functions to feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attributes."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"symbolAvoidsEdges","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"symbolAvoidsEdges","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"symbolAvoidsEdges","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSymbolStyleLayer(py)symbolAvoidsEdges","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNSymbolStyleLayer/symbolAvoidsEdges":{"abstract":[{"text":"Whether symbols in this layer avoid colliding with symbols in adjacent tiles.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/symbolAvoidsEdges","title":"symbolAvoidsEdges","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"symbolAvoidsEdges"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer\/symbolavoidsedges","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNSymbolPlacement/MLNSymbolPlacementPoint":{"abstract":[{"text":"The label is placed at the point where the geometry is located.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolPlacement\/MLNSymbolPlacementPoint","title":"MLNSymbolPlacementPoint","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNSymbolPlacementPoint"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolplacement\/mlnsymbolplacementpoint","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc:/